      "value": "@{60f11dfa18c99e29577d531d|full_name} Yeah my vague understanding of the avatar sync bits is that they're sent alongside other information, and they're trying to stick everything within a single packet. So if they have room, sure, but they might not have room in the packet that is sent ten times a second.",
